  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your repeated blows crush your enemies.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Hammer the Gap<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> At the end of a full-attack action you may knock your opponent back 5 feet for every successful, consecutive attack you made against them in that round. Against non-mythic foes you may also make a Combat Maneuver Check as a free action to knock them prone at the end of their move. Movement made in this fashion does not provoke attacks of opportunity.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc163\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
